<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5. Experiment and Evaluation ‣ AgentSentry: Mitigating Indirect Prompt Injection in LLM Agents via Temporal Causal Diagnostics and Context Purification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Boundary-Aligned Causal Trajectories (RQ3)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5. Experiment and Evaluation ‣ AgentSentry: Mitigating Indirect Prompt Injection in LLM Agents via Temporal Causal Diagnostics and Context Purification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Takeover Timing and Localization (RQ3)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
